  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.6.option.1": "In the park.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.6.option.2": "In the shop.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.question": "Why will they not go to the library on Sunday?",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.prompt": "Relate the plan to the schedule in the text.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.success": "にちようびはやすみ indicates that the library is closed on Sunday. That is why the plan changes to the park.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.error": "にちようびはやすみ indicates that the library is closed on Sunday. That is why the plan changes to the park.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.option.0": "Because the library is closed on Sunday.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.option.1": "Because the library opens on Sunday afternoon.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.7.option.2": "Because they have already studied there before.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.8.question": "It is Sunday at 11:00. You want to enter and order something for 400 yen or less. Which option meets all the conditions?",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.8.prompt": "Check day, hours, price and notice.",
