  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.8.error": "On Sunday it opens from 10 to 16. At 11 you can enter; おちゃ costs 300 yen and meets the 400 maximum.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.8.option.0": "Enter and order tea.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.8.option.1": "Enter and order coffee.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.8.option.2": "Enter at 9:00 and order cake.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.9.question": "Find the incorrect unit in the polite past.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.9.prompt": "The intended meaning is “It was cold yesterday”.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.9.success": "Replace さむいでした with さむかったです: the い adjective forms its past with かった and keeps です.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.9.error": "Replace さむいでした with さむかったです: the い adjective forms its past with かった and keeps です.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.10.question": "Which answer fits the plan and experience in the text?",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.10.prompt": "Distinguish past experience from future intention.",
  "grammar.audit.lesson.10.10.success": "まだ…いったことがありません denies experience up to now; らいねん…つもり expresses future intention.",
