  "grammar.stable.02.8.question": "Select what reinforces “not difficult at all”.",
  "grammar.stable.02.8.feedback": "ぜんぜん accompanies negation to express “not at all”.",
  "grammar.stable.03.1.question": "Select the action in “I drink”.",
  "grammar.stable.03.1.feedback": "のみます expresses the action; わたし is the person and は introduces the topic.",
