  "grammar.expansion.10.1-exp-1.prompt": "えきでパンをかって、うちにかえります。 · えき = station · パン = bread · かう = buy · かえる = return",
  "grammar.expansion.10.1-exp-1.success": "で locates buying; に indicates the destination of returning.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.1-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. で locates buying; に indicates the destination of returning.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.2-exp-1.question": "Match forms without losing tense or negation.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.2-exp-1.prompt": "Combine two registers.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.2-exp-1.success": "The equivalence retains past tense and polarity while changing register.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.2-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. The equivalence retains past tense and polarity while changing register.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.3-exp-1.question": "Select the form required by the following link.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.3-exp-1.prompt": "コーヒーを＿まえに、みずをのみます。 · コーヒー = coffee · のむ = drink · みず = water",
  "grammar.expansion.10.3-exp-1.success": "まえに requires the dictionary form; the form is not chosen solely for its meaning.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.3-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. まえに requires the dictionary form; the form is not chosen solely for its meaning.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-1.question": "Select the relative clause that describes the person.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-1.prompt": "きのうきたひとは、せんせいです。 · きのう = yesterday · くる = come · ひと = person · せんせい = teacher",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-1.success": "The relative clause きのうきた precedes the noun ひと.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. The relative clause きのうきた precedes the noun ひと.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-2.question": "Build “I want to go to the library to read”. Start with としょかんに.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-2.prompt": "Combine destination, purpose and desire.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-2.success": "よみに expresses purpose; いきたい describes the desire to go.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.4-exp-2.error": "Review the pattern. よみに expresses purpose; いきたい describes the desire to go.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.question": "Which relationship keeps the text coherent?",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.prompt": "あめがふっています。そとにいきません。 Two sentences: reason and decision. · あめ = rain · ふる = fall (rain) · そと = outside · いく = go",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.success": "The rain explains staying; から and ので allow that cause to be expressed.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. The rain explains staying; から and ので allow that cause to be expressed.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.option.0": "Contrast with けど",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.option.1": "Cause with から or ので",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-1.option.2": "Open list with や",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-2.question": "Join the ideas: “It is expensive, but I want to buy it”. Start with たかいですけど.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-2.prompt": "Do not change the desire into a negation.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-2.success": "けど retains the contrast between the high price and the desire to buy.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.5-exp-2.error": "Review the pattern. けど retains the contrast between the high price and the desire to buy.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.question": "Where will Yuki be after studying?",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.prompt": "Read the Japanese text and answer using its information.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.success": "してから places the visit to the library after studying.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. してから places the visit to the library after studying.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.option.0": "At home",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.option.1": "At the library",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.option.2": "In the park",
  "grammar.expansion.10.7-exp-1.question": "Select the plan that has not yet been carried out.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.7-exp-1.prompt": "Read the Japanese text and answer using its information.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.7-exp-1.success": "あした and つもり indicate future intention; the other actions are past and current.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.7-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. あした and つもり indicate future intention; the other actions are past and current.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.question": "You arrive at eleven and want to read a book. What does the notice allow?",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.prompt": "Read the Japanese text and answer using its information.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.success": "Eleven is within opening hours and reading is allowed; bringing outside food is prohibited.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. Eleven is within opening hours and reading is allowed; bringing outside food is prohibited.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.option.0": "Enter at eleven and read",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.option.1": "Bring food from outside",
  "grammar.expansion.10.8-exp-1.option.2": "Enter before ten",
  "grammar.expansion.10.9-exp-1.question": "Match each error to the correction with the same meaning.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.9-exp-1.prompt": "Do not change tense or polarity. · たかい = expensive / tall · なる = become",
  "grammar.expansion.10.9-exp-1.success": "な adjective + に for change; い adjective + かった for past tense.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.9-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. な adjective + に for change; い adjective + かった for past tense.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.question": "Which answer respects a request and retains the permission given by the place?",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.prompt": "Read the Japanese text and answer using its information.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.success": "B grants permission to read and asks not to speak; B does not prohibit reading.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.error": "Review the pattern. B grants permission to read and asks not to speak; B does not prohibit reading.",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.option.0": "You can read in silence",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.option.1": "Speaking is obligatory",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.option.2": "Reading is never allowed",
  "grammar.expansion.10.6-exp-1.context": "ゆきさんはあさ、うちでべんきょうします。べんきょうしてから、としょかんにいきます。そこでほんをかります。 · ゆきさん = Yuki · あさ = morning (part of the day) · うち = home · べんきょうする = study · いく = go · そこで = there",
  "grammar.expansion.10.7-exp-1.context": "きのう、ゆきさんはとしょかんでほんをかりました。きょうはそのほんをよんでいます。あしたはともだちにかえすつもりです。 · ゆきさん = Yuki · きのう = yesterday · きょう = today · ともだち = friend · かえす = give back",
  "grammar.expansion.10.10-exp-1.context": "A: ここでほんをよんでもいいですか。 B: はい。でも、はなさないでください。 · ここ = here · はなす = speak",
