  "grammar.v2.particle-ga-identifier-2.feedback.0": "は introduces a topic; it does not by itself add “also” or identify the answer to 誰.",
  "grammar.v2.particle-ga-identifier-2.feedback.1": "も adds an item to which the same preceding information applies.",
