  "grammar.v2.particle-wa-vs-ga-2.explanation": "The requested function is introducing a topic.",
  "grammar.v2.particle-wa-vs-ga-2.feedback.0": "は introduces a topic; it does not by itself add “also” or identify the answer to 誰.",
  "grammar.v2.particle-wa-vs-ga-2.feedback.1": "も adds an item to which the same preceding information applies.",
  "grammar.v2.particle-wa-vs-ga-2.feedback.2": "が indicates here who fits the description being sought.",
  "grammar.v2.particle-wa-vs-ga-3.prompt": "In reply to 誰が先生？, you want to highlight who it is: 山田さん＿先生だ。",
  "grammar.v2.particle-wa-vs-ga-3.explanation": "The requested function is identifying, not adding “also”.",
